{"version":1,"key":"card:6","content":{"id":6,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e60e7f8a-aaaa-4078-ac33-a1c03119b072","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以通过索引类型定义接口的键值需要符合的约束"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"f77b8a80-144e-4143-bf6c-40e0fcfbc854","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"faa3ba74-b6f6-4cb5-bfb9-1837a9eb9bcf","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"interface Something {\n  // 这个 key 可以随便写成什么有语义的东西\n  [key: string]: string;\n  // [fieldName: string]: string;\n}","collabId":"98df5528-1fc6-445a-b702-05e585a3e824","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1493510a-0469-473c-885f-dad13a6bfa0f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面定义了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Something"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的键必须为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"string"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型，值也必须为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"string"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型。不过因为 JavaScript 通过数字索引去访问属性时，会被转换为字符串，因此此时键是数字可以可以的"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"8983f749-3820-4080-a918-f342c275d97f","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"5c808782-7625-4aee-b646-6c3947289d85","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// ✅\nconst something: Something = {\n  name: 'John',\n  1: \"2\",\n}","collabId":"4e718fb3-7176-4a54-893a-c709c64514ed","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"fcecf5a7-8153-4791-9fd3-27b57e0a67f6","tauContrac